## Issue add notification
## $issue(EdsIncident) - Newly created issue
## $user - User submitted this alert

<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head>

<body>
<h1>Solr Optimization completed on $date.</h1>
<p><b>Optimization Elapsed Time for:</b> </p>
<p><b>Core0 :</b> $core0</p>
<p><b>Core1 :</b> $core1</p>
<p><b>Contact Core :</b> $contactCore</p>
<p><b>Folder Core :</b> $folderCore</p>
<p><b>Lead Core :</b> $leadCore</p>
<p><b>Sale Invoice Core :</b> $saleInvoiceCore</p>
<p><b>Task Core :</b> $taskCore</p>
<p> <b><i>The QTime</i></b> is the time it takes for the query to execute in Solr<br />
    whereas the <b><i>Elapsed Time </i></b>is the total time taken including the transmission and serialization / deserialization of the results.</p>

</body>
